      "message": "chore(process): PROCESS_VERSION 72\n\nPR #1790 (merged as 8b297dcb) changed process files under xtask/: the\nrelease gate runs independent lanes up to four at a time, and\n`cargo xtask release` accepts a Cargo.lock change that is only CRLF line\nendings. The merging session bumps PROCESS_VERSION (#1153).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
